    "gold.crash_geo": {
      "title": "Crash geospatial enrichment",
      "description": "Exactly one row per gold.fact_crash.crash_sk, including rows with no geometry. The single table Phases 5-7 read for census geography, H3, timezone, road snap and weather. fact_crash and dim_geography are NOT widened: Phase 3's hashes and tests must not move, and an enrichment table can be rebuilt from hashed reference inputs without restating the fact. Geometry is EPSG:4326 WKB (NULL where geo_quality is not OK -- coordinates are already NULL for every non-OK row in silver). Every metric column names the projected CRS it was computed in: snap_crs_epsg. Every NULL has a status column saying why: pip_status, time_status, snap_status, weather_status.",
